                     <title>Formulare</title>
                     <note type="MLGB3_generalNotes">For contents see short note by E. L[obel] 'A
                        xvc. MS. in private hands' BQR 5, pp. 134f.</note>
                     <note type="MLGB3_generalNotes">An erased note on fol. 2r states that it was
                        goven to All Souls by James Goldwell bp. of Norwich. It had apparently been
                        earlier at Ch. Ch. Canterbury and is in a Canterbury binding of c.
                        1450–1500. See Count Roberto Weiss, 'Some unpublished correspondence of
                        Guarino da Verona', Italian Studies Febr. 1939, pp. 110–113.</note>
                  </msItem>
